[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "Oh, que magnifique!"
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "It has been a while,"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "Travis."
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "So you've finally resumed work"
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "as an assassin."
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "And still a hygiene-impaired slob,"
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "I see."
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "Sylvia...?"
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "Is that it?"
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "You gotta be kidding!"
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "I haven't seen you in three years,"
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "and that's the welcome I get?"
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "How 'bout you fill us in on everything"
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "that's happened since the last game?"
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "We're not gonna be satisfied"
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "until you do."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "Right?"
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "Oh give me a break..."
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "There are people starting "
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "from this sequel"
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "who don't care "
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "about continuity, you know."
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "Besides, it would take forever "
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "if I recapped every detail"
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "of your fall from greatness. "
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "Players would skip it, it's so boring."
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "Well I,"
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "I guess you gotta point there."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "Sometimes you have to look at"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "things from different angles."
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "Now may I? This man was the"
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "51st ranked assassin..."
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "Since you've killed him, "
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "text": "that officially makes you 51st."
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "text": "And that means you're qualified to"
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "text": "fight in the ranking battles again."
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "text": "So how about it?"
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "text": "If you're a real man, you'll do "
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "text": "anything to climb back on top."
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "text": "Because trust me, the view is"
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "text": "still very... Satisfying."
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "text": "Hold on.  Why would I have to start "
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "text": "from rank 51 this time?!"
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "text": "More competition.  The last game's success"
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "text": "made assassination trendy."
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "text": "But I already fought my way to number"
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "text": "one before!"
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "text": "Shouldn't I get a special fast"
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "text": "track to the title fight?"
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "text": "No.  But you will get "
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "text": "a special prize."
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "text": "Shut up."
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "text": "You can't bribe me this time. "
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "text": "I've already tasted those goods."
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "text": "But just a taste. This time you'll"
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "text": "get the five course meal. "
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "text": "Five course?"
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "text": "Wait, I don't get what that means."
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "text": "Did you know I am a Yoga master?"
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "text": "You-- You don't say. "
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "text": "Are you familiar with"
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "text": "any yoga positions?"
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "text": "Like uh, "
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "text": "down-- downward dog?"
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "text": "The dog can do all sorts of things.  "
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "text": "So can the cobra, the rabbit..."
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "text": "Co-Cobra?  Rabbit?"
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "text": "Like together? "
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "text": "Hold on!"
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "text": "I'm in it to win it, baby!"
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "text": "Number one here I come!"
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "text": "Hey! We're not done yet!"
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "text": "I've got a message for you. "
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "text": "Oh my..."
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "text": "He's still alive."
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "text": "Pain in MY ass..."
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "text": "Why aren't you dead yet?"
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "text": "Such blind arrogance like "
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "text": "the naked emperor."
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "text": "Seriously!"
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "text": "I cut off your head!"
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "text": "Travis. "
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "text": "You are the loser."
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "text": "This fight was only part of"
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "text": "our plan."
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "text": "Our plan?"
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "text": "I said I'd avenge you killing "
  },
  {
    "id": 87,
    "text": "my brother, didn't I?"
  },
  {
    "id": 88,
    "text": "Who's been a brother to you?"
  },
  {
    "id": 89,
    "text": "What...?"
  },
  {
    "id": 90,
    "text": "Travis..."
  },
  {
    "id": 91,
    "text": "Don't think you can kill without"
  },
  {
    "id": 92,
    "text": "suffering consequences."
  },
  {
    "id": 93,
    "text": "To kill someone is not simply "
  },
  {
    "id": 94,
    "text": "to end their life."
  },
  {
    "id": 95,
    "text": "One must risk their entire being"
  },
  {
    "id": 96,
    "text": "in order to destroy another's."
  },
  {
    "id": 97,
    "text": "Up until now you've had it easy."
  },
  {
    "id": 98,
    "text": "I've taken the curse you gave me--"
  },
  {
    "id": 99,
    "text": "The shackles of revenge--"
  },
  {
    "id": 100,
    "text": "And I'm throwing them back on you."
  },
  {
    "id": 101,
    "text": "Now it's your turn to be burdened "
  },
  {
    "id": 102,
    "text": "with another's death."
  },
  {
    "id": 103,
    "text": "It has destroyed me, and it will "
  },
  {
    "id": 104,
    "text": "destroy you, too."
  },
  {
    "id": 105,
    "text": "This is ultimate vengeance!"
  }
]